WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.558
Red Bird's tree was on the ground.

2
00:00:28.559 --> 00:00:32.176
"Poor Red Bird," said Cat.

3
00:00:32.177 --> 00:00:40.394
"His home is ruined," said Bat.

4
00:00:40.395 --> 00:00:44.152
"We must help Red Bird," said Dog.

5
00:00:44.153 --> 00:00:48.441
"I wish I could help," said Pig.

6
00:00:48.442 --> 00:00:52.110
"But that tree looks heavy."

7
00:00:52.111 --> 00:00:56.121
Then Pig had an idea.

8
00:00:56.122 --> 00:01:02.075
"Don't worry, Red Bird," said Pig.

9
00:01:02.076 --> 00:01:05.507
"Super Pig will help you!"

10
00:01:05.508 --> 00:01:15.951
Pig went over to a big tree.

11
00:01:15.952 --> 00:01:20.140
"This tree is strong," said Pig.

12
00:01:20.141 --> 00:01:26.323
Pig hung from a branch.

13
00:01:26.324 --> 00:01:30.363
"This branch is strong," said Pig.

14
00:01:30.364 --> 00:01:35.023
"Red Bird can live in this tree!"

15
00:01:35.024 --> 00:01:39.857
Pig hung Red Bird's feeder.

16
00:01:39.858 --> 00:01:50.549
He found a spot for Red Bird's nest.

17
00:01:50.551 --> 00:02:01.334
Red Bird flew happy circles around Pig.

18
00:02:01.335 --> 00:02:05.955
"You're Red Bird's hero!" said Bat.

19
00:02:05.956 --> 00:02:10.439
"I am," said Pig.

20
00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:15.729
And he took a bow.

